 "summary": "Query language of Grafana Tempo for distributed traces: spanset filters over span intrinsics and attributes ({ span.http.status_code >= 500 }), combined with logical and structural operators (parent/child, ancestor/descendant, sibling), piped through aggregators, grouping and selection, plus TraceQL metrics functions producing time series.",
 "status": "active",
